########################
# FACEBOOK SERVICE API #
########################

- Retrieve up to 1000 IDs whose corresponding names contain the string <string>

  HTTP operation: GET
  Path:           /facebook/search?string=<string>
  Returns:        String[]
  Status code:    [200 OK]          in case of success
                  [400 Bad Request] if no string has been specified


- Retrieve the name corresponding to ID {id}

  HTTP operation: GET
  Path:           /facebook/names/{id}
  Returns:        String
  Status code:    [200 OK]        in case of success
                  [404 Not Found] if the specified ID does not exist


- Retrieve the IDs of all friends for ID {id}

  HTTP operation: GET
  Path:           /facebook/friends/{id}
  Returns:        String[]
  Status code:    [200 OK]        in case of success
                  [404 Not Found] if the specified ID does not exist


++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
+ BATCH METHODS FOR EXERCISE 1.2.3 (OPTIONAL FOR 5.0 ECTS) +
++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++

- Batch method for retrieving the names corresponding to different IDs

  HTTP operation: POST
  Path:           /facebook/names
  Request-Body:   A String[] containing the IDs to process
  Returns:        String[] in which the i-th element represents the name of the i-th ID requested
  Status code:    [200 OK]          in case of success
                  [400 Bad Request] if no ID array has been specified


- Batch method for retrieving the IDs of friends for different IDs

  HTTP operation: POST
  Path:           /facebook/friends
  Request-Body:   A String[] containing the IDs to process
  Returns:        A Map<String, HashSet<String>> in which the keys represent the IDs to process; for each key, the associated value contains the IDs of the key's friends
  Status code:    [200 OK]          in case of success
                  [400 Bad Request] if no ID array has been specified
